## Registry mirror for tests — the ONE place test code takes gameplay numbers from.
##
## Every value below names the `design/registry/entities.yaml` entry (or the GDD
## section) it mirrors, so a test never carries an inline magic number
## (coding-standards: "No hardcoded data"). When the registry changes, change
## it here and the suites follow. Production code must NOT read this file: its
## numbers come from `assets/data/*.json` through the Card Database `config()`
## (DD-T01); this mirror exists so tests can assert against the design intent
## independently of the data files.
##
## Generated by /test-helpers scaffold on 2026-11-03. Sections: registry
## `constants:` block, then per-GDD constants that are internal to one GDD and
## therefore not registered.
class_name TestConstants
extends RefCounted

